Reference portraits
===================

The three portrait files in this directory (fizz.png, honey.png, bumble.png)
are derivative works. They come from block/buzz:

  https://github.com/block/buzz
  desktop/public/onboarding/starter-team/
  commit 1aab50e950f2b7ef75cc6ec6e6055de681a4bff7 (2026-07-17)

That repository is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Copyright 2026 Block, Inc.

A copy of the Apache License, Version 2.0 is in the LICENSE file at the root
of this repository.

Statement of changes
--------------------

The originals are full standing figures, 160 pixels wide, on a transparent
background. The files here have been modified. Each one was cropped to a
square anchored on the head, composited onto a white background, and resized
to 384 by 384 pixels. Nothing else was altered. No colour, shape or detail was
changed.

The crop exists because this project generates bust portraits, and an image
model copies the composition of the references it is shown. Sending the full
standing figures produces standing figures.

To re-derive these files yourself from the originals, run:

    ./refs/fetch.sh

That downloads the unmodified originals into refs/originals and regenerates
the crops with refs/make_references.py, so you can verify the provenance
rather than taking this file's word for it.

